name=HARMONIE - Home Medic
id=HARMONIE_HomeMedic
description=A complete health overhaul for Build 42, all in one mod: Extensive Health Rework Evolved B42 (Workshop 3726328119) and The Only Cure (Workshop 3580276809, by ZioPao, github.com/ZioPao/The-Only-Cure) merged in with their authors' permission -- blood volume, diseases, wounds, medication, surgery, amputation and prostheses. Adds traditional/folk medicine items, blood loss you can feel (stamina ceiling and darkening vision that throbs with your heartbeat), The Only Cure surgery options inside the medical window (also when treating another player) a per-player delirium sound volume / mute, and a surgery system (Debridement, Abscess Drainage) built from reusable procedure minigames with a pre-op checklist. English and Thai built in. Replaces both mods: do NOT enable Extensive Health Rework Evolved or The Only Cure together with this mod (existing saves keep their health and amputation data).
poster=poster.png
icon=icon.png
modversion=0.6.0
versionMin=42.20
loadModAfter=\FancyHandwork,\BrutalHandwork,\TwoWeaponsOnBackRework
incompatible=\BB_FirstAidOverhaul,\ExtensiveHealthReworkEvolved,\TheOnlyCure
